{"id":"n82663-1-7","stage":5,"title":"티 · 神态","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82663-1-7-1","ko":"너 언제 왔어? 들어오는 거 못 봤는데.","zh":"你什么时候来的？我没看到你进来啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어오는","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤는데.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/feadb3487d04be7e924a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82663-1-7-2","ko":"늦은 거 티 안 나게 뒷문으로 살짝 들어왔지.","zh":"为了不显得迟到，我就从后门悄悄进来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"늦은","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"티","meaning":"神态，样子","explanation":"티：神态，样子","readings":[{"term":"티","audio":"/audio/ce4ea7d5e6eff9bdb23e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82663","senseId":"1","lemma":"티","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나게","meaning":"显露出来（티가 나다：显露迹象、被看出）","explanation":"나다：显露出来（티가 나다：显露迹象、被看出）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"4","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒷문으로","meaning":"后门","explanation":"뒷문：后门；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒷문","audio":"/audio/c58b0c94d24ac2be56e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15020","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살짝","meaning":"偷偷地","explanation":"살짝：偷偷地","readings":[{"term":"살짝","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61612","senseId":"4","lemma":"살짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어왔지.","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"ce4ea7d5e6eff9bd","term":"티","zh":"神态，样子","audio":"/audio/ce4ea7d5e6eff9bdb23e.mp3","entryId":"82663","definition":"某种态度或脸色。","pronunciation":["티"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"显露出来（티가 나다：显露迹象、被看出）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"显露出来（티가 나다：显露迹象、被看出）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"c58b0c94d24ac2be","term":"뒷문","zh":"后门","audio":"/audio/c58b0c94d24ac2be56e7.mp3","entryId":"15020","definition":"房间或建筑后面的门。","pronunciation":["뒨ː문"]},{"id":"cf17ce5604310bf9","term":"살짝","zh":"偷偷地","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3","entryId":"61612","definition":"不表露出来，悄悄地。","pronunciation":["살짝"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3621f29e04c7269619d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.409,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82663","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为了不显得迟到，我就从后门悄悄进来了。","听说智秀的病情正在恶化？","你什么时候来的？我没看到你进来啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为了不显得迟到，我就从后门悄悄进来了。","你什么时候来的？我没看到你进来啊。","听说智秀的病情正在恶化？"],"answer":0}]}
